### ── Security Tests ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### testAndAllQualify — requires auth (all security schemes qualify together)
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/and-all-qualify
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testAndNotAllQualify — no security annotation, no token needed
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/and-not-all-qualify

### testApiKey — requires auth (API key scheme, but enforced as @RolesAllowed(**))
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/api-key
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testHttpBasic — requires auth (HTTP Basic scheme, enforced as @RolesAllowed(**))
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/http-basic
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testHttpBearer — requires auth (HTTP Bearer scheme)
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/http-bearer
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testMtls — requires auth (mTLS scheme, enforced as @RolesAllowed(**))
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/mtls
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testNoSecurity — no security annotation, no token needed
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/no-security

### testOauth2EmptyScopes — requires auth (OAuth2, no specific scopes)
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/oauth2-empty-scopes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testOauth2WithScopes — no security annotation generated (scopes not mapped to roles)
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/oauth2-with-scopes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testOpenIdEmptyScopes — requires auth (OpenID Connect, no specific scopes)
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/openid-empty-scopes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### testOrOneQualifies — requires auth (at least one security scheme qualifies)
GET http://localhost:8080/security-tests/or-one-qualifies
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

